        "MedicalAudience instead of the generic Audience your live markup uses. It is a real",
        "schema.org type and it is the single clearest signal that this page is scoped to",
        "healthcare rather than being another general recycling page.",
        "",
        "Add the enterprise qualifier here too — this is where Fortune 500 / large health system",
        "targeting belongs in the markup. See README.md §5: structured data supports the",
